abstract: >-
  A framework, its mathematics and the tests that check it, with every claim shelved under HAT
  (Honest, Accurate, Truth). Includes the Hubble closure test, a breathing limit from DESI DR2 and
  Pantheon+, the EPR verdict, and three tests on official SPARC galaxy data: one acceleration scale
  against 153 galaxies, the baryonic Tully-Fisher slope (3.85 +/- 0.09, reproducing Lelli et al. 2019),
  and a 3D Delaunay tetrahedralization of all 175 galaxies against shuffled controls. Also a pi
  precision test, digit by digit.
keywords:
  - cosmology
  - MOND
  - Bell inequality
  - limit cycle
  - reproducibility
  - SPARC
  - Tully-Fisher
  - Delaunay tessellation
